        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Kr-Xe-concentrate with 99.7% O2 is obtained from a side column of large air separation plants. Processes as purification and further distillation and the achieved yield may vary. Data represents an average process.\n\n# Included processes\nXenon, krypron as ressource, Electricity for process, cooling water and waste heat. Estimation for process infrastructure .</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
